Z||000000||RedGTFieroKCMO||12-09-2001||01:10 PM||||Can someone tell me the part # and how to replace this?? I was told it's leaking.<P>thanks,  <IMG SRC="http://www.fiero.nl/forum/wink.gif">||||reg||5
Z||000001||avengador1||12-09-2001||05:41 PM||||If you are talking about the oil seal at the base of the distributor shaft where it goes into the engine, I can tell you that the Fiero store has them. Their web site is <A HREF="http://www.fierostore.com" TARGET=_blank>www.fierostore.com</A>  Look under "ignition" hope this helps.<P>------------------<BR>  <IMG SRC="http://www.fiero.nl/uploads/Avendgador1.jpg">  <p>[This message has been edited by avengador1 (edited 12-09-2001).]||||reg||1
